{"ID":"20240205164741-8ptq82v","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164741-8ptq82v","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164741-8ptq82v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114755-qsmylbe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611143623-g21ne71\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624160752-vch8g72\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"170百合","type":"doc","updated":"20240814143945"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206114755-qsmylbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114755-qsmylbe","updated":"20240206114804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于四川、云南、贵州、湖南、湖北、陕西等地区。\n【性状】\t卷丹：鳞叶长23.5cm，宽1.53cm，厚13cm，表面乳白色或淡黄棕色，有纵直的脉纹38条，质硬而脆；折断，断面平坦，角质样。无臭，味微苦。\n百合：鳞叶呈长椭圆形，顶端尖，基部较宽，微波状，向内卷曲，长1.53cm，宽0.51cm，厚约4mm，有脉3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5条，有的不明显。表面白色或淡黄色，光滑半透明，质硬而脆，易折断，断面平坦，角质样，无臭，味苦。\n细叶百合：鳞叶长约5.5cm，宽约2.5cm，厚至3.5mm，色较暗，脉纹不太明显。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t养阴润肺，清心安神。用于阴虚久咳，痰中带血，虚烦惊悸，失眠多梦，精神恍惚。"}]},{"ID":"20240206114757-ykrn9et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114757-ykrn9et","updated":"20240206114757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 511px;","style":"width: 501px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206114757-w26op6i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 501px;\" parent-style=\"width: 511px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165539-hl5oc7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165539-hl5oc7x","updated":